{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1000_p", "source_sha256": "af6e598a72fcda8d00266e10c161ddf7e0333b8a413038b9199ce29de78fd9a2", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影がある。\nまだ時間もあるし、要点を確認しておくか）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》。\n时间还早，先确认一下重点吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9a2d72f003be99f60dd415eb1a67c7b59b14f025a940a0f9491c6dc015c4f6d5", "ja": "（……っと、この手帳もそろそろいっぱいだな。\n新しいのを買わないと……）", "zh": "（……话说回来，这本记事本也快写满了。得买本新的了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "13a544a501c4a21179cae9a32736f1beddf8331450cb232dcc06c2e380e7b9c8", "ja": "{$P$}くん～！　見て見て～！\n最っ高にセクシーな仕上がりじゃない♪", "zh": "{$P$}～！快看快看～！\n这身造型是不是性感到爆了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1003_p", "source_sha256": "832baf266e995735b175fb7fb914484df9b67e2c38c06e00005dddd819824f9d", "ja": "……ん？　ああ、莉緒。お疲れさま。\nあれ？　もう着替えたのか？", "zh": "……嗯？啊，莉绪。辛苦了。\n咦？已经换好衣服了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "2368c814eba02b5b12392cf7f1a181ec08639048c81ea8897ec48d27777dab88", "ja": "ええ！　だって、すごく素敵な衣装なんだもの。\n時間まで待ちきれなくて……先に着替えちゃった♪", "zh": "是呀！因为这套服装实在太棒了嘛。\n我等不到时间到了……就先换上了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "5b93201f357d9c2d03d151c7f14184e209c4f28ef9050026ce81932bd8261c3e", "ja": "今日はギリギリを攻めるわよ～。脚線美も体のラインも\nセクシーに見えるように、朝ヨガしてきたんだから！", "zh": "今天要挑战极限啦～。为了让腿部线条和身材曲线看起来更性感，我可是今早做了瑜伽才来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f877e909a621b7ff87c9cf4929f0a475d5cffe2753b764fe176016b9e35ebbe7", "ja": "（確かに、色っぽく見える気がするな。\nただ、ちょっと気合いが入りすぎてるような……）", "zh": "（确实，感觉看起来挺性感的。只是……好像有点太过卖力了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "2edc01ff9d041137ef6a5ea228727353ca3581d700f965ce0ab22f47b96118dc", "ja": "ちょっとちょっと～！\n{$P$}くん、私の話聞いてる？", "zh": "喂喂～！{$P$}先生，你在听我说话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "c7a4f66446f47aad5f495bacb99da6b4cd0d0f19172ad7bdb9601027684f4a27", "ja": "うふっ♪　セクシースパイ莉緒の前で、\nボーっとしてると……いただきっ♪", "zh": "呵呵♪　在性感间谍莉绪面前\n发呆的话……得手啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1009_null", "source_sha256": "6ebf414d75eb0087975aca5c1ae1e0d573350102a3c782589862be829999a68b", "ja": "パシッ！", "zh": "啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c993afff7b969a682b8fb0c88dcbb41df404748d0c145d68d9ca41f1ad3bb253", "ja": "ああっ！？\nお、おい、返してくれ！　その手帳は……！", "zh": "啊啊！？\n喂、喂，快还给我！那本记事本……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "9ef82afb420e94ff8263dee03b34575873640a9a9ad8207c525cc4de0f92a747", "ja": "油断するからいけないのよ♪　今日の私はスパイなの。\nその焦り方！　あやしいわね～。", "zh": "就是因为你太大意了嘛♪ 今天的我可是间谍哦。\n你这慌张的样子！很可疑呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "69d09d4b07cc934185f3aa3b0990501606d5999e1f31e9433fbf57399fd39899", "ja": "秘密のポエムとか書いてたりして……ウフフ♪\nどれどれ～……。", "zh": "该不会还写了什么秘密诗歌之类的……嘻嘻♪\n我看看～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1013_p", "source_sha256": "194b8da8426eafe49898ceada9a7f4d04112f6984864ce049576bee471b3f191", "ja": "莉緒！　頼むから……。", "zh": "莉绪！拜托了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "94911ed14b2db46f9c4e1155ccc3e81dbec1c8a88df94f7f69f67630d77650ec", "ja": "あら？　書き込みがいっぱい……。\n『今日は莉緒の、スタイルの良さをアピール！』……。", "zh": "哎呀？留言好多啊……\n“今天要好好展示莉绪的好身材！”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "f086cf6a45aaace311bfe54ca2de6364c206767bc505953fb67728f5dfd61165", "ja": "うんうん！　よくわかってるじゃない～♪\nそれで、こっちは……えっ！？", "zh": "嗯嗯！还真是了解我呢～♪\n然后，这边是……诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "126ed8a0305c5acb2cc9fde4076e96edcb63bc77645471a84a14ef120d69ab62", "ja": "ちょっと、{$P$}くん！\n『セクシーは抑えめに！』って、どういうことよ～！？", "zh": "等一下，{$P$}！\n“性感收敛一点！”是什么意思啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5987e9fc010ee90d09eb7f9950d11e2b007902b7a5e82c50ea787ecee22a018b", "ja": "いや、どういうこともなにも……。\n莉緒はちょっと、張り切りすぎるところがあるからな。", "zh": "没、倒也没什么怎么回事……\n莉绪有时候就是太爱逞强了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8b6734bd424e349ff91c48b929ab53ca3dcf95d3d5b2ff09589fd11c49bdf9ef", "ja": "そのままでも、十分綺麗なんだから。\n自然体で勝負してほしいなって。そういうことだよ。", "zh": "就算保持原样，也已经足够漂亮了。我只是希望你能以自然的状态去展现自己。就是这个意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "97abae0e3c6d75ecd0bb13f7eb1b561d0e5ee7fd0c49046a3468df0ef1129a51", "ja": "えっ……ちょ、ちょっと……。\nそんな、不意打ちなんて、ずるいわよ～！", "zh": "诶……等、等一下……\n突然来这一出，太狡猾了吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e14c4b3942d7b4daea94d0d0431841e124a87c339167b5e37e30531148f711f2", "ja": "いいから。手帳を返してくれ。", "zh": "好啦。把记事本还我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "4a611e5bc946322a6268251282b1c2b0709f642bf77b8cd9e7e4fc99529f6b90", "ja": "はーい……。\nふぅ、まさか私の方が奪われちゃうなんてね……。", "zh": "好——……  \n呼，真没想到反倒是我的手账被抢走了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0213_1022_046rio", "source_sha256": "6f690bef5887fb9d9d9798cab98f2dc5b84ac09bab8358855b5d5e463ca28672", "ja": "わかったわ。今日は自然体でいくわよ～！\nキミの情報、ちゃんと役立ててみせるんだから♪", "zh": "我知道啦。今天我就顺其自然地上吧～！\n你的情报，我一定会好好派上用场的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
